|One place where people discussed it was on the [https://www.minecraftforum.net Minecraft Forums], where it was discovered that the tabs at the top of the change list, which were partly covered, could be decoded based on the one-pixel tall pattern available in the image.<ref>https://www.minecraftforum.net/topic/379958-</ref>
