'''Bone blocks''' are storage [[block]]s equivalent to 9 pieces of [[bone meal]]. 

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Bone blocks can be [[breaking|mined]] using any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they [[drop]] nothing.

{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Bone Block|Pickaxe|Wood}}

=== Natural generation ===
[[File:CaveFossil.png|thumb|Bone blocks generated naturally underground as part of a fossil.]]
Bone blocks are generated naturally as part of [[fossil]] structures found in [[desert]] and [[swamp]] biomes. They also generate as part of [[nether fossil]]s in [[soul sand valley]] biomes and also in [[trial chambers]] indicating [[trial spawner]]s if it is a [[skeleton]] and a mixture with [[podzol]] indicating if it is a [[bogged]].

